Description: Restore VERSION/SOVERSION on liboffload shared libraries
 Upstream commit 3383f0d6fe01 ("[Offload] Fix build install directory and
 remove 'add_llvm_library'") replaced add_llvm_library() with plain
 add_library() for the LLVMOffload and omptarget shared libraries.
 add_llvm_library() implicitly set VERSION/SOVERSION to
 LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR.LLVM_VERSION_MINOR (see
 llvm/cmake/modules/AddLLVM.cmake), producing
 libLLVMOffload.so.23.0 and libomptarget.so.23.0.
 .
 With that property gone, the libraries are installed without any
 version suffix, breaking the Debian packaging which ships
 liboffload-23 with the .so.23.0 SONAME-style files. dh_install fails:
 .
   dh_install: warning: Cannot find (any matches for)
     "usr/lib/llvm-23/lib/libLLVMOffload.so.23.0"
   dh_install: warning: Cannot find (any matches for)
     "usr/lib/llvm-23/lib/libomptarget*.so.23.0"
 .
 Restore the previous behavior by setting VERSION and SOVERSION
 explicitly on both targets.
Bug: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues/198622
Forwarded: no
Author: Sylvestre Ledru <sylvestre@debian.org>

Index: llvm-toolchain-snapshot_23~++20260528104113+af772866888e/offload/liboffload/CMakeLists.txt
===================================================================
--- llvm-toolchain-snapshot_23~++20260528104113+af772866888e.orig/offload/liboffload/CMakeLists.txt
+++ llvm-toolchain-snapshot_23~++20260528104113+af772866888e/offload/liboffload/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -40,6 +40,8 @@ target_compile_definitions(LLVMOffload P
 
 set_target_properties(LLVMOffload PROPERTIES
                       POSITION_INDEPENDENT_CODE ON
+                      VERSION ${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR}.${LLVM_VERSION_MINOR}
+                      SOVERSION ${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR}.${LLVM_VERSION_MINOR}
                       INSTALL_RPATH "$ORIGIN"
                       BUILD_RPATH "$ORIGIN:${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/..")
 if(UNIX AND NOT APPLE)
Index: llvm-toolchain-snapshot_23~++20260528104113+af772866888e/offload/libomptarget/CMakeLists.txt
===================================================================
--- llvm-toolchain-snapshot_23~++20260528104113+af772866888e.orig/offload/libomptarget/CMakeLists.txt
+++ llvm-toolchain-snapshot_23~++20260528104113+af772866888e/offload/libomptarget/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -55,6 +55,8 @@ target_link_options(omptarget PRIVATE ${
 # are now separated in the build directory.
 set_target_properties(omptarget PROPERTIES
                       POSITION_INDEPENDENT_CODE ON
+                      VERSION ${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR}.${LLVM_VERSION_MINOR}
+                      SOVERSION ${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR}.${LLVM_VERSION_MINOR}
                       INSTALL_RPATH "$ORIGIN"
                       BUILD_RPATH "$ORIGIN:${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/..")
 if(UNIX AND NOT APPLE)
